Similarly to the $r$ even case, for binary Goppa codes with square-free Goppa polynomials, \eqref{eq: ratio_rodd} provides the exact ratio of rank $(r-1)m-2$ matrices in $\Cmat(\cA)$ (or $\Cmat(\cB)$). 
\end{remark}
