+        "Exactly two base-10 integers [p,t]: the stated prime modulus p followed "
+        "by one field element 0 <= t < p; p is fixed by the instance."
+    ),
+    "bounds": {
+        "atomic_elements": 2,
+        "shift_choices_max": FIELD_PRIME,
+        "integer_bits": 31,
